Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:16:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bedrock): render animated persona face geometry

Bedrock Character Creator skins can split the body and animated face into separate geometry models and textures. Render the face as a synchronized player layer so these skins no longer fall back to a Java model. Validate the two-model layout and face atlas before installing it.
